WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.878
Learn's client page gives
the prerequisites: a joined,

2
00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:09.880
hybrid joined or registered device, though
registered devices carry only Private

3
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:15.187
Access, in preview; an administrator to
install; IPv4 only; and no secure DNS.

4
00:00:15.187 --> 00:00:19.335
It gives the Intune values,
the DNS-over-HTTPS profile,

5
00:00:19.335 --> 00:00:25.838
four hardening registry values, and the
advice to let users run unrestricted first.

6
00:00:25.838 --> 00:00:29.630
For the fleet, the beta device
usage summary counts total,

7
00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.987
active and inactive devices, with
Network Access Policy Read All.

8
00:00:33.987 --> 00:00:40.524
Clients 1.8.239 or later use Universal
Continuous Access Evaluation.

9
00:00:40.524 --> 00:00:45.006
One difference: the summary's parameter
table marks traffic type required,

10
00:00:45.006 --> 00:00:47.880
while its own example and
the guide leave it out.
